00:46:21.000 --> 00:47:03.000
ignored Brady and changed the subject, but now he needed money. So they made a plan to rob the Williams and Glens bank located on Ashtonale Road, 14 kilometers away from Hattersley. Hindley would be the driver, and Brady and David would take care of the rest. David's assignment was to take notes of arrivals and departures from the bank, paying particular attention to when the cash fan arrived. David spent an entire day outside the bank taking notes. When he gave them to Brady, he barely glanced at them. He then put them aside like they weren't important. That was as far as their bank robbery got. One night soon after, they were having a drink together, and during the session,

